Description: finish driver discovery before accepting D-Bus claims
 Synchronous SSC discovery iterates the main context. A desktop client
 can claim a partially initialized driver while discovery is in progress.
 Initialize drivers before publishing the bus name and interfaces.
Forwarded: no
--- a/src/iio-sensor-proxy.c
